      <div class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl bg-white px-16 max-lg:px-10 max-sm:px-6 pt-10 pb-12 opacity-0" id="content"><section data-section-type="activity_open_ended_answer" data-section-id="pg034_sec001" class="mx-auto max-w-4xl"><h1 class="adt-h2 mb-4 text-amber-700 font-bold" data-id="pg034_n0003">Barazi p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;</h1><h3 class="adt-h3 mb-5 text-black" data-id="pg034_n0005">Situata 1.</h3><div class="mb-8 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 px-5 py-4"><p class="adt-body leading-relaxed text-gray-900"><span data-id="pg034_n0007">Aktiviteti fizik &#xeb;sht&#xeb; i sh&#xeb;ndetsh&#xeb;m p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; gjith&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg034_n0008">F&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t zakonisht p&#xeb;lqejn&#xeb; loj&#xeb;rat n&#xeb; natyr&#xeb;.</span></p><p class="adt-body mt-2 leading-relaxed text-gray-900"><span data-id="pg034_n0009">N&#xeb; shkoll&#xeb; do ta zhvillonim turneun e futbollit.</span> <span data-id="pg034_n0010">Secili, sipas interesave, shprehu d&#xeb;shir&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; qen&#xeb; pjes&#xeb;marr&#xeb;s n&#xeb; ekip.</span></p><p class="adt-body mt-2 leading-relaxed text-gray-900"><span data-id="pg034_n0011">Ne luanim shpesh futboll n&#xeb; koh&#xeb;n e lir&#xeb;.</span> <span data-id="pg034_n0012">Blerta nuk u p&#xeb;rfshi n&#xeb; ekipin e shkoll&#xeb;s</span></p></div><div class="mb-0 overflow-hidden rounded-t-sm"><img data-id="pg034_im001" src="images/pg034_im001.png" alt="Tre f&#xeb;mij&#xeb; luajn&#xeb; futboll n&#xeb; park, nd&#xeb;rsa nj&#xeb; vajz&#xeb; e ulur anash i shikon, e pap&#xeb;rfshir&#xeb; n&#xeb; loj&#xeb;." class="block w-full h-auto"></div><div class="bg-purple-100 px-6 py-5 max-sm:px-4"><div class="space-y-6"><div><p class="adt-body mb-2 text-gray-900"><span data-id="pg034_n0013">Vazhdoni tregimin dhe b&#xeb;jeni nj&#xeb; zgjidhje t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Blert&#xeb;n.</span></p><label for="activity-item-1" class="sr-only">Vazhdoni tregimin dhe b&#xeb;jeni nj&#xeb; zgjidhje t&#xeb; drejt&#xeb; p&#xeb;r Blert&#xeb;n.</la